  "StockRole": "Light Scout",
  "YangsThoughts": "Based on the 3P variant and introduced in 3076, this model also uses Endo Steel chassis and adds an XL Engine. The engine gives the STG-5G a top speed of 111 km/h and provides enough weight savings to add more armor and an advanced PPC Capacitor. ",
